          "heading": "Fiji's Koli Sewabu says FRU will follow Mark Nawaqanitawase's possible switch",
          "body": "FRU chief executive Koli Sewabu says Fiji are following Mark Nawaqanitawase's possible switch of allegiance with interest, after the winger's agent said he was weighing up a move ahead of his return to union. The 11-cap Wallabies winger is eligible for Fiji, Italy and Australia. Wallabies coach Les Kiss, meanwhile, says: \"I'll wait until the end of the year to see where he sits.\""
