          "body": "Desiree Miller became the first Wallaroo to score 20 women's Test tries in Australia's 56-12 win over Scotland at Accor Stadium in Sydney on Saturday. Shifted to full-back, the speedster scored from near-identical plays off scrums as Australia piled up 42 consecutive points. Amelia Whitaker scored her maiden try for the Wallaroos, and Scotland's tries came from Katie Buchanan and captain Rachel Malcolm."
